OL,3,GNEWSANo bullying complaints about MSP
OL,4,AMonica Lennon, Scottish Labour leader
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra
OL,8,Fsays the party has not received any
OL,9,Fcomplaints about MSP Monica Lennon.
OL,11,FIt comes after The Scotsman reported
OL,12,Fthat four of Lennon's former staffers
OL,13,Fhad accused her of bullying.
OL,15,FThe Glasgow MSP has denied the
OL,16,Fallegations and described them as
OL,17,Fdefamatory.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
