OL,3,GNEWSANo bullying complaints about MSP
OL,4,AMonica Lennon, Scottish Labour leader
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarra, who saw off competition from
OL,8,FLennon to win the Scottish Labour
OL,9,Fleadership this summer, said that
OL,10,Fneither the party nor its parliamentary
OL,11,Fgroup had received a complaint.
